@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Luồng Gọi Món & Thanh Toán (Đề tài 11)

autonumber
actor "Khách Hàng" as User
participant "Menu.razor" as UI
participant "ScopedOrderState" as State
participant "PlaceTableOrderUseCase" as PlaceUC
participant "TableOrder (Entity)" as Entity
participant "TableOrderRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB
actor "Thu Ngân" as Cashier
participant "Tables.razor" as AdminUI
participant "CloseTableOrderUseCase" as CloseUC

== 1. Khách Hàng Gọi Món Tại Bàn ==
User -> UI: Chọn Bàn (đang Mở) & Thêm món vào giỏ
UI -> State: AddItem(menuItem, quantity)
User -> UI: Bấm "Gửi gọi món vào bếp"
UI -> PlaceUC: ExecuteAsync(tableId, itemId, price, quantity)
PlaceUC -> Repo: GetActiveOrderForTableAsync(tableId)
Repo -> DB: SELECT TableOrder & Lines
DB --> Repo: activeOrder
Repo --> PlaceUC: activeOrder

PlaceUC -> Entity: AddLineItem(itemId, price, qty, table)
note right of Entity
  **Luật nghiệp vụ 2 (CoreBusiness):**
  1. Bàn phải đang Mở (IsOccupied == true)
  2. Order chưa bị đóng (IsClosed == false)
end note

alt Bàn chưa mở hoặc Đã đóng bill
    Entity --> PlaceUC: throw InvalidOperationException
    PlaceUC --> UI: Hiển thị thông báo lỗi thân thiện (K3.3)
else Hợp lệ
    PlaceUC -> Repo: SaveOrderAsync() / UpdateOrderAsync()
    Repo -> DB: **BEGIN TRANSACTION** (K2.2)
    Repo -> DB: INSERT/UPDATE TableOrder
    Repo -> DB: INSERT TableOrderLine
    Repo -> DB: **COMMIT TRANSACTION**
    DB --> Repo: Success
    Repo --> PlaceUC: Success
    PlaceUC --> UI: "Đã gửi gọi món thành công"
end

== 2. Thu Ngân Đóng Bill & Thanh Toán ==
Cashier -> AdminUI: Nhấn "Đóng Bill & Thanh Toán"
AdminUI -> CloseUC: ExecuteAsync(tableId)
CloseUC -> Repo: GetActiveOrderForTableAsync(tableId)
Repo --> CloseUC: activeOrder
CloseUC -> Entity: CloseOrder()
note right of Entity
  **Tính toán hóa đơn:**
  TotalAmount = SubTotal + 10% Phí phục vụ
  IsClosed = true
end note
CloseUC -> Repo: UpdateOrderAsync(activeOrder)
CloseUC -> Repo: UpdateTableStatusAsync(tableId, isOccupied: false)
CloseUC --> AdminUI: "Đã thanh toán & Bàn trở về trạng thái trống"
@enduml
